ThoughtLoud artwork
===================

The original `src/voxd/assets/thoughtloud*.svg` artwork and its
`thoughtloud*.png` renders are licensed under the MIT license in LICENSE.
They are independent artwork, not derivatives of the VOXD logo. Recreate
the PNG renders with `packaging/render_icons.py` using the locked build
environment; the SVG files remain the editable originals.

